- B | ring the players' director, and ask what it would take to be cast in something good | v: achievement, power | door | tribal: ask the shaper of the telling, quietly, what it would take to be given a real part | magic: call on the pageant master, and ask what it would take to be cast well | chance: 75
- R | turn up at the auditions on a whim, and sing the song from the school play | v: stimulation, hedonism | title: amateur actor | tribal: walk into the tellers' circle and dance the hare the way you always wanted to | magic: turn up at the trials on a whim, and sing the song from the old masque | chance: 70
- G | let it rest: that part belongs to the child you were | v: tradition, security | tribal: let it rest: that part belongs to the child you were | magic: let it rest: the masque belongs to the child you were | chance: 80
