works: {N} steps onto a stage again, or close to one, and finds the old ache has turned into something better.
works: Within a few months {N} has a part, a place or a plan, and wonders what took so long.
fails: The day comes and goes, and {N} stays home and tells no one.
fails: {N} goes along, feels too old and too slow among the regulars, and does not go back.

== never too late for the stage
tier: echo
rate: 0.02
once: yes
stages: mature elder
